title Bench: bike on a stand, pedalled at 60 rpm (virtual controller for the config tool)

# Used with ride_sim --serial (see BUILDING.md): a real-time controller on a
# pseudo-terminal for testing the config tool's code without the bike.
bike pas_edge_error_deg 0.3
at 0 gear 2.0
at 2000 cadence 60 over 1000
at 0 level 0

end 600000
